<title>UK: BOE gives money mkt 600 mln stg help at set rates.</title>
<headline>BOE gives money mkt 600 mln stg help at set rates.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England said that it provided the UK money market with 600 million stg of assistance at established interest rates.  </p>
<p>			    EARLY	1200 GMT   1400 GMT   LATE</p>
<p> FORECAST SHORTAGE    1.1 BLN    =	    =	    =</p>
<p> CUMULATIVE SUPPLY    600 MLN!   =	    =	    =</p>
<p>! INCLUDES 600 MLN STG REPO EXPIRING IN EQUAL AMOUNTS ON JAN 13 &amp; 14 AT 5-31/32 PCT</p>
<p>(INDICATES UNCHANGED BASE RATES)</p>
</text>
